table\n- Not Reproducible in 4.1.4 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.2.stable - macOS 14.5.0 - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (10 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nFor certain heights, the `TextEdit` displays text only displays when the line is fully visible, like a popping into existence effect. This also causes the last line to appear to repeat twice when scrolling down.\n\nFor one line; the following heights have issues: 15-21, 23-24, 26-29, 31-32, 34 px\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82f8544a-3491-44d5-9da7-ca0a70ed694b\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a scene with a TextEdit Node\n2. Set the text to \"0\"\n3. Set the size to (100, 32)\n4. Run the scene, and scroll down on the TextEdit\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19400545/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"